@startuml
title Sequence Diagram "Bottle-Label OCR During Sample Creation"

actor "Collector" as C
boundary "Add Olive Oil Sample Interface" as I
control "Collector Sample Service" as S
control "Django OCR Endpoint" as API

group Bottle-Label OCR During Sample Creation
    C -> I : 1. Select bottle-label photo
    I -> S : 2. Send photo for OCR extraction
    S -> API : 3. Submit bottle-label photo
    API --> S : 4. Return extracted sample fields
    S --> I : 5. Return OCR result

    I --> C : 6. Display extracted fields
    C -> I : 7. Verify and correct the fields
    I -> I : 8. Fill the sample form with verified data
end

@enduml
